--- !u!114 &8323973812718689173
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7439471691194851343}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 25a98cb3857bdae43814b27182482d56, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SowurShield.Runtime::SowurShield.Dialogue.NPCDialogueInteractable
  npcId: elias
  npcDisplayName: Elias
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a1f2a1a19e8bdc24199831ef4b08551b, type: 3}
  npcBioLocalized:
    m_TableReference:
      m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
    m_TableEntryReference:
      m_KeyId: 14950889754976256
      m_Key: 
    m_FallbackState: 0
    m_WaitForCompletion: 0
    m_LocalVariables: []
  npcBio: "Pastor. Conversa com as ovelhas e afirma, muito s\xE9rio, que elas respondem."
  availableDialogues:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e8e05cdeadff04f4e840dbc13c643491, type: 2}
  defaultDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e8e05cdeadff04f4e840dbc13c643491, type: 2}
  interactionPrompt: {fileID: 5428894214525145936}
  dialogueBox: {fileID: 0}
  interactionRange: 3
  allowRepeatedConversations: 1
  cooldownBetweenInteractions: 1
  disableMovementDuringDialogue: 1
  enableGifting: 1
  enableSeedShop: 0
  shopData: {fileID: 0}
  loreEntries:
  - requiredRelationship: 0
    titleLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889754976257
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    title: "Quem \xE9 Elias?"
    bodyLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889754976258
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    body: O pastor. Some no campo por dias e volta como se nada fosse.
  - requiredRelationship: 10
    titleLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889754976259
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    title: O Rebanho
    bodyLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889759170560
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    body: "Ele d\xE1 nome a cada animal do rebanho e nunca confunde nenhum."
  - requiredRelationship: 40
    titleLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889759170561
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    title: A Noite da Tempestade
    bodyLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889763364864
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    body: Passou uma noite inteira na chuva procurando uma ovelha perdida. Achou.
  - requiredRelationship: 75
    titleLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889763364865
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    title: "O Sil\xEAncio"
    bodyLocalized:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: Dialogue
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 14950889767559168
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    body: "Elias gosta do sil\xEAncio do campo porque, segundo ele, \xE9 o \xFAnico
      lugar onde consegue pensar direito."
  lovedGifts:
  - Cabbage
  - Milk
  likedGifts:
  - Carrot
  - Tomato
  dislikedGifts:
  - Fish
  dailyTalkAffinity: 1
  interactionSound: {fileID: 0}
  audioSource: {fileID: 0}
  references:
